  "title": "Return is not print",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## The stage hears `say`, not `console.log`\n\n`status()` should **return** `\"locked\"`. Then `Player.say(status())` shows that word on the fox. Printing to the console is a notebook, not the result the next function can use."
    },
